{"id":"75e301ab0a784049","group":"88","path":"88/88-thm-kleene-recursion.md","title":"Kleene Recursion Theorem","display":"thm-kleene-recursion — Kleene Recursion Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-thm-kleene-recursion","aliases":["88-thm-kleene-recursion"],"display":"thm-kleene-recursion — Kleene Recursion Theorem","depends_on":["[[88-df-recursion-theorem]]","[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]","[[88-df-computable-function]]","[[88-thm-smn]]","[[88-lem-recursion]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-thm-kleene-recursion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-thm-kleene-recursion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kleene-recursion — Kleene Recursion Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c0d94132cfe19e7e\" href=\"?note=c0d94132cfe19e7e\" title=\"88-df-recursion-theorem\">88-df-recursion-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eb17d82fac64b1a6\" href=\"?note=eb17d82fac64b1a6\" title=\"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">88-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2e54d7c09866228f\" href=\"?note=2e54d7c09866228f\" title=\"88-thm-smn\">88-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"96267a91020ab600\" href=\"?note=96267a91020ab600\" title=\"88-lem-recursion\">88-lem-recursion</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\geq1}\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\geq1}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a> 的共同编号环境。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"eb17d82fac64b1a6\" href=\"?note=eb17d82fac64b1a6\" title=\"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">88-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"64279ecae5246baf\" href=\"?note=64279ecae5246baf\" title=\"88-df-computable-function\">88-df-computable-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KFP}\">\\(\\mathrm{KFP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c0d94132cfe19e7e\" href=\"?note=c0d94132cfe19e7e\" title=\"88-df-recursion-theorem\">88-df-recursion-theorem</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 为候选总可计算索引变换。所需的参数函数存在性由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"2e54d7c09866228f\" href=\"?note=2e54d7c09866228f\" title=\"88-thm-smn\">88-thm-smn</a> 提供，固定点推导见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"96267a91020ab600\" href=\"?note=96267a91020ab600\" title=\"88-lem-recursion\">88-lem-recursion</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\to\n\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(f)\n\\to\\mathrm{KFP}(f)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\to\n\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(f)\n\\to\\mathrm{KFP}(f)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由可接受性和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 定理取得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}(s)\">\\(\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}(s)\\)</span>，再应用递归引理。结论是存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e=\\varphi_{f(e)}\">\\(\\varphi_e=\\varphi_{f(e)}\\)</span>，并不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e=f(e)\">\\(e=f(e)\\)</span>。与旧版本不同，可接受性不再藏在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KFP}\">\\(\\mathrm{KFP}\\)</span> 的定义中，也不再从任意“有效编号”无条件推出固定点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-recursion-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"c0d94132cfe19e7e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-recursion-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"eb17d82fac64b1a6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-computable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"2e54d7c09866228f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-lem-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"96267a91020ab600","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-lem-recursion]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\geq1}$ 是 [[88-df-effective-program-numbering]] 的共同编号环境。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"eb17d82fac64b1a6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)$ 见 [[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]；$\\mathrm{Comp}_1$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]；$\\mathrm{KFP}$ 见 [[88-df-recursion-theorem]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-computable-function","status":"resolved","id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)$ 见 [[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]；$\\mathrm{Comp}_1$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]；$\\mathrm{KFP}$ 见 [[88-df-recursion-theorem]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-recursion-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"c0d94132cfe19e7e","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)$ 见 [[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]；$\\mathrm{Comp}_1$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]；$\\mathrm{KFP}$ 见 [[88-df-recursion-theorem]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"2e54d7c09866228f","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f$ 为候选总可计算索引变换。所需的参数函数存在性由 [[88-thm-smn]] 提供，固定点推导见 [[88-lem-recursion]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-lem-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"96267a91020ab600","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f$ 为候选总可计算索引变换。所需的参数函数存在性由 [[88-thm-smn]] 提供，固定点推导见 [[88-lem-recursion]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KFP}","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\to\n\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Comp}_1(f)\n\\to\\mathrm{KFP}(f)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}(s)","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e=\\varphi_{f(e)}","display":false},{"tex":"e=f(e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KFP}","display":false}],"bytes":1442,"backlinks":[{"id":"c0d94132cfe19e7e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-lem-recursion]] 明确使用 $s$-$m$-$n$ 前提推出固定点；[[88-thm-kleene-recursion]] 再由可接受编号推出该前提。因此性质、足够条件与存在性定理不再混在一个定义式里。"},{"id":"17e23d087321028e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"有效记号表示的递归构造使用 [[88-thm-kleene-recursion]]；这不是定义 $\\mathcal O_{88}$ 时额外假定的范围等式。"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-173","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-thm-ackermann-not-pr.md]]\n[[88-thm-arithmetical-hierarchy-strict.md]]\n[[88-thm-compactness.md]]\n[[88-thm-completeness.md]]\n[[88-thm-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[88-thm-friedberg-muchnik.md]]\n[[88-thm-halting-problem.md]]\n[[88-thm-halting-undecidable.md]]\n[[88-thm-jump-strict-def.md]]\n[[88-thm-jump-strict.md]]\n[[88-thm-kleene-normal-form.md]]\n[[88-thm-kleene-recursion.md]]\n[[88-thm-lob.md]]\n[[88-thm-lowenheim-skolem.md]]\n[[88-thm-ls-upward.md]]\n[[88-thm-partial-tm-equivalence.md]]\n[[88-thm-post-problem-solved.md]]\n[[88-thm-post-theorem.md]]\n[[88-thm-pr-total.md]]\n[[88-thm-rice-proof.md]]\n[[88-thm-rice.md]]\n[[88-thm-second-incompleteness.md]]\n[[88-thm-sigma1-complete.md]]\n[[88-thm-smn.md]]\n[[88-thm-soundness.md]]\n[[88-thm-tm-equals-recursive.md]]\n[[88-thm-tm-recursive.md]]"}],"outgoing":["c0d94132cfe19e7e","b955b7851c500bfe","eb17d82fac64b1a6","64279ecae5246baf","2e54d7c09866228f","96267a91020ab600"]}